{"name": "Relic Arena", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"113\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/e64a12e2d6eb9f8efec204a87621d294.avif?t=1785550588\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/23f2fc0c425bed4049f55304faf5dcdc.poster.avif?t=1785550588\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/23f2fc0c425bed4049f55304faf5dcdc.webm?t=1785550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/23f2fc0c425bed4049f55304faf5dcdc.mp4?t=1785550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relic Arena</strong> is a free-to-play multiplayer autobattler from the unhinged minds of Dota legends SUNSfan and Jenkins. Build your own heroes, craft insane combos, and rewrite history with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"105\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/31b268c6a6a065bd723650a32bd52889.avif?t=1785550588\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/358858050a82b54769fe1d7548a6bd3b.poster.avif?t=1785550588\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/358858050a82b54769fe1d7548a6bd3b.webm?t=1785550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/358858050a82b54769fe1d7548a6bd3b.mp4?t=1785550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike other autobattlers, <strong>units are free</strong>\u2014you just buy the spells. Each round, grab historical <strong>Relics</strong> from the shop and slap them onto any unit you want. Every Relic provides unique abilities and upgrade paths, letting you craft deadly combos on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 85+ Relics and 3 upgrade paths each, no two games will ever be alike.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"116\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/da1df0d87961f36c66febd72adb866b7.avif?t=1785550588\" width=\"785\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/40f4f0c2bb57395af323c7caa90c2a99.avif?t=1785550588\" width=\"844\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaders</strong> don\u2019t just tweak the game\u2014they <i>rewrite</i> it. Want to destroy your enemy from the inside out? Try Vlad the Impaler. Want to master the economy? Pick Karl Marx. Or are you just hungry for bananas? Then Harambe is the leader for you! Every Leader has a unique ability that can be leveled up, unlocking game-breaking powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/ff4300b90102b30bcdc3b8965ace68e3.avif?t=1785550588\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/ad01ba7741397fefe15111953b299845.poster.avif?t=1785550588\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/ad01ba7741397fefe15111953b299845.webm?t=1785550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/ad01ba7741397fefe15111953b299845.mp4?t=1785550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buying the same <strong>Relic </strong>again powers it up\u2014unlocking <strong>Super Upgrades</strong>. Max it out, and you\u2019ll get a <strong>Juicy Upgrade</strong>: a devastating power spike that is so strong, it can end the game outright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you will have to choose carefully what you invest gold in. Go all-in on one Relic? Spread your gold between many Relics? Level your leader? The right call could win you the game\u2026 or cost you everything.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Relic Arena is an 8-player free-to-play autobattler. Equip heroes with relics and build game-breaking combos, led by legendary historical figures.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/7649129fd3c3cc4b9380b23752acc6f4b4d84626/header.jpg?t=1785550588", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Free to Play", "Auto Battler", "Strategy", "Casual", "Multiplayer", "PvP"], "developers": "Double Edge Games", "publishers": "Double Edge Games", "release_date": "May 7, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "2654490", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 May 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/B5wzLQVCdrg", "first_seen": 1778104800.0, "review_rank": 667}